<title>UK: Dollar/yen steady awaiting April U.S. trade report.</title>
<headline>Dollar/yen steady awaiting April U.S. trade report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollar steady vs yen, awaiting April U.S. trade report at 1230 GMT. Dollar/mark clambers back above 1.73. Ifo said West German business climate index rose to 95.3 in May vs 94.7 in April. Sterling steady near 2.84 marks, before National Audit Office report at 1430 GMT. French PM Lionel Jospin delivers keynote speech to parliament at 1300 GMT.</p>
</text>
